            <h1 class="post-heading">Bank of Canada raises the policy rate by 25 basis points to 2½%</h1>
        <div class='post-meta'>
            <div>FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE</div>
                <div class="post-authors">
                            <a href="https://www.bankofcanada.ca/press/contacts/"  >Media Relations</a>
                </div>
                <div class='post-location'><a href="https://www.bankofcanada.ca/location/ottawa_ontario/"  >Ottawa, Ontario</a></div>
                <div class='post-date'>October 28, 2026</div>
            <div class="bocss-share bocss-share--basic-small">
